  "meta": {
    "createdAt": "2026-11-04T00:00:00.000Z",
    "notes": "An interim vehicle: a rideable mob with a script, until MSM has a vehicle kind. The kart is a mob with no AI goals, so it never moves by itself. msm:rideable with saddle false lets anyone get in with an empty hand and drive it with W, A, S and D, with a second seat behind the driver (passengers 2); sneaking gets out. step_height 1 lets it drive up full blocks. Its spawn egg is the kart item: use it on the ground to place a kart. Being a mob, it can still be hurt (fire, falls) and pushed.",
